⚡ 🇸🇩 The SAF and their allies, the Joint Forces, managed to recapture 5 towns in Sudan's North Kordofan after they were under RSF control for months.
The towns are Bara, Um Garfa, Gabrat El Sheikh, Al-Baraka, and Umm Sayyalah

